#: src/main.glade:122
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks "
"to the camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps ("
"or in daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to kee"
"p unlocking reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Ngan hiji modél rupa anu didaptarkeun. Cahya robih kumaha raray anjeun"
" katingali ka kaméra, janten modél tunggal tiasa gagal dina soré handa"
"peun lampu (atanapi dina terangan). Tambihkeun modél kadua anu dirékam"
" dina lampu anu béda pikeun tetep muka konci anu dipercaya iraha waé d"
"ina sapoe."

