" ka unggal kartu. Mangpaat nalika ngalaporkeun masalah."

#: src/main.glade:655 src/onboarding.glade:116
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Keyring / KWallet Otomatis-Buka Konci"

#: src/main.glade:672
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Aktipkeun auténtikasi raray pikeun otomatis muka konci ring keyring an"
"jeun atanapi KWallet on login. Ieu sacara aman nyimpen kecap akses anj"
"eun anu disegel dina TPM upami sayogi, atanapi énkripsi nganggo AES-25"
"6-GCM nganggo konci master wungkul. Set auth raray PAM_AUTHTOK pikeun "
"pam_gnome_keyring atawa pam_kwallet5 gumantung kana desktop Anjeun."

