msgstr "Wilujeng sumping di Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.glade:68
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Setup rengse!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:87
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing any"
"thing you would normally have to type your password for to authenticat"
"e, like running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unloc"
"k, your login keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically o"
"n login.\n\nYou can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to cha"
"nge more advanced settings or add additional models. Press Finish belo"
"w to close this window and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Urang geus rengse! Ubuntu Hello ayeuna aktip dina komputer ieu. Coba l"
"akukeun naon waé anu anjeun biasana kedah ngetik kecap konci anjeun pi"
"keun ngabuktoskeunana, sapertos ngajalankeun paréntah nganggo sudo. Up"
"ami anjeun ngaktipkeun konci konci otomatis buka konci, keyring login "
"anjeun atanapi KWallet oge bakal otomatis muka konci nalika login.\n\n"
"Anjeun tiasa muka Ubuntu Hello Configurator engké pikeun ngarobah sete"
"lan nu leuwih maju atawa nambahkeun model tambahan. Pencét Rengse di h"
"andap pikeun nutup jandela ieu sareng muka Ubuntu Hello Configurator."

#: src/onboarding.glade:135
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet us"
"ing face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello tiasa otomatis muka konci keyring login anjeun atanapi KW"
"allet nganggo auténtikasi raray, nyegah kecap akses saatos log in."

#: src/onboarding.glade:147
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Aktipkeun cingcin konci otomatis/KWallet muka konci"

#: src/onboarding.glade:189
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Pastikeun Kecap konci"

#: src/onboarding.glade:221
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Netepkeun kawijakan kapastian"

#: src/onboarding.glade:240
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match"
" is never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you "
"can set how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Kusabab parobihan sudut, jarak, sareng faktor sanésna, pertandingan ra"
"ray henteu persis sami sareng modél raray anu disimpen. Dina halaman i"
"eu anjeun tiasa nyetél sabaraha ketat Ubuntu Hello kedahna."

#: src/onboarding.glade:279
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Gancang"

#: src/onboarding.glade:295
msgid ""
"Allows more fuzzy matches, \nbut speeds up the scanning process greatl"
"y."
msgstr ""
"Ngidinan patandingan anu langkung kabur, \ntapi speeds up prosés scann"
"ing greatly."

#: src/onboarding.glade:334
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Saimbang"

#: src/onboarding.glade:350
msgid ""
"Still relatively quick detection, \nbut might not log you in when furt"
"her away."
msgstr ""
"Masih rélatif gancang deteksi, \ntapi bisa jadi teu asup anjeun nalika"
" leuwih jauh."

#: src/onboarding.glade:389
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Aman"

#: src/onboarding.glade:405
